{"release":{"id":334618769,"tag":"v0.2.0","author":"SolitaryThinker","name":"Release 0.2.0","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-06-04T21:22:49Z","publishedAt":"2026-06-04T21:24:02Z","markdown":"## What's Changed\r\n* Added longcat-video python api examples by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/994\r\n* [docs]: add LoRA extraction utilities documentation by @ShreejithSG in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/992\r\n* [bugfix] Add configs for TurboDiffusion T2V/I2V models by @loaydatrain in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/993\r\n* [ci] temporarily disable turbodiffusion ssim test  by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1000\r\n* [CI] Fixed Turbodiffusion I2V CI  by @loaydatrain in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1002\r\n* [feat!] Disable FSDP inference by default by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1001\r\n* [misc] [bugfix] unpin 'av' in pyproject by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1009\r\n* [feat] Introduce Cosmos 2.5 Text2World pipeline by @KyleShao1016 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/974\r\n* [CI] SSIM tests optimization: load all model weights from Modal persistent Volume by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/958\r\n* [CI] Fix OOM issues in ssim tests by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1011\r\n* [Bug Fix] Add autograd wrapper for block-sparse attention in fastvideo-kernel + fix CMake extension linking by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1015\r\n* [chore] release fastvideo-kernel 0.2.3 by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1018\r\n* [feat] Hooks API and layerwise offloading for all DiTs by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1006\r\n* [kernel] Fix fastvideo-kernel release workflow by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1019\r\n* [kernel] [bugfix] [ci] bump v0.2.4. Fix STA output handling, TurboDiffusion CUDA norm dtypes for fastvideo-kernel unit tests. by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1020\r\n* Added LTX-2 Distilled T2V Generation by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1016\r\n* fix: SP for hunyuanvideo 1.5 by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1026\r\n* [fastvideo-kernel] replace map to index with Triton implementation + add vsa benchmark by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1029\r\n* [bugfix] add omegaconf as dep. by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1032\r\n* [bugfix] Allow update timesteps for hy1.5 model. by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1033\r\n* [feat] Add HY-World1.5-Bidirectional-480P-I2V by @mignonjia in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1027\r\n* [ci] Increase ci test error threshold by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1038\r\n* [bugfix] Fix NCCL all_gather contiguity + correct ParallelTiledVAE decode tiling threshold by @KyleShao1016 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1037\r\n* [bugfix]: handle architectural differences while lora extraction by @ShreejithSG in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1035\r\n* [bugfix] fix torchvision import by @RandNMR73 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1039\r\n* [docs] Update runpod instructions by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1043\r\n* [docs] Offloading instruction by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1022\r\n* [feat]Add Matrix Game 2.0 training by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1017\r\n* [docs] Update design overview and add agents tutorial by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1044\r\n* [SP Sharding] Fix SP loss sharding on token axis (thw) with padding; add distributed correctness tests by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1045\r\n* fix: sageattn3 installation by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1050\r\n* [bugfix] Double Normalization in Preprocessing Dataset by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1055\r\n* [Bugfix] [Wan I2V] Fix CLIP Image encoder config by @JerryZhou54 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1063\r\n* [chore]: use higher precision timestamp in logging by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1062\r\n* [feat] Add Cosmos 2.5 I2W/V2W support (staged pipeline + examples) by @KyleShao1016 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1021\r\n* Added Sequence Parallelism for LTX-2 Distilled by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1036\r\n* [misc] upgrade torch to 2.10 by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1048\r\n* [feat] HYworld VAE with cache by @mignonjia in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1057\r\n* [misc] Fix naming instruction in runpod.md by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1067\r\n* [refactor] Action module by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1065\r\n* [core] Refactor and centralize our registry for models, pipelines, and sampling params by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1066\r\n* Some minor fixes by @zhisbug in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1068\r\n* [Feature] [Hy1.5] Support HY1.5 super-resolution pipeline for 1080p videos by @JerryZhou54 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1046\r\n* [Fix] remove video ratio limitation by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1069\r\n* more fix and relocate STA arguments to pipeline config by @zhisbug in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1073\r\n* [perf]: use CUDA IPC in multiproc executor to avoid serialization overhead by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1061\r\n* readme small fix 