n* [bugfix] fix import PreTrainedModel in stepllm.py by @dsynkd in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1108\r\n* Update README.md by @dsynkd in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1110\r\n* [Feat] Native dit implementation for SD3.5 by @Ishxn20 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1093\r\n* [Misc] clean up VSA finetuning examples. by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1111\r\n* [bugfix] get_torch_device and other device calls were being made on non-cuda platforms by @dsynkd in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1107\r\n* [misc] add hy-world link to readme by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1113\r\n* Improve Docs by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1112\r\n* Upstream LTX2 Training by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1116\r\n* [Misc] Remove StepVideo by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1118\r\n* small refactor in post-processing to improve efficiency by @RandNMR73 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1123\r\n* [Misc] Remove Teacache by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1121\r\n* [bugfix] Added ltx2 guidance missing modulation term by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1100\r\n* [Misc] Remove STA by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1124\r\n* [Feat] Improved CI by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1119\r\n* [misc] fix hunyuan by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1125\r\n* migrate uv by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1127\r\n* [fix] preprocessing issue by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1134\r\n* [bugfix] fix matrix game kv indexing by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1135\r\n* [Misc] Fix memory leakage in VideoGenerator by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1132\r\n* Py/fix sp by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1138\r\n* [CI][Feat] launch 2 instance to run ssim by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1137\r\n* [bugfix]: fix a bug where collect_env was not running properly... by @dsynkd in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1145\r\n* [Doc] add doc for inference architecture by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1147\r\n* Added OpenAI-compatible API server and benchmark script by @AjAnubolu in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1109\r\n* [Refactor] SP Mask --> original seq len; HunyuanVideo 1.5 does not need mask by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1142\r\n* [CI] Add inference performance regression tests by @AjAnubolu in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1140\r\n* [CI] PR template by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1157\r\n* [misc] FlashAttention 4 support by @XOR-op in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1114\r\n* feat: Building agent friendly repo by @GindaChen in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1151\r\n* [Feat] Add causal Wan pipeline with multi-step denoising    by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1161\r\n* [feat] Refactor training framework into fastvideo/train by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1159\r\n* Py/cleanup by @jzhang38 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1163\r\n* [feat] Self-Forcing methods in refactored training infra by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1164\r\n* [feat] pre-commit support 120 col num by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1167\r\n* [feat]: Knowledge Distillation training method for ODE-init (KDMethod + KDCausalMethod) by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1166\r\n* [docs] Update README with realtime demo announcement by @zhisbug in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1169