em in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1196\r\n* [ci] Fix Merge Queue requeue and draft PR pre-commit skip by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1197\r\n* [ci](mergify): upgrade configuration to current format by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1194\r\n* [ci] Replace Merge Queue with auto-merge — reduce CI complexity by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1200\r\n* [ci] Fix fork PR checkout for /test and Full Suite triggers by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1202\r\n* [ci] Add TEST_SCOPE routing for clean single-test execution by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1203\r\n* [ci] Trigger pre-commit on /test slash commands by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1205\r\n* [ci] Post pre-commit status to PR commit SHA by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1206\r\n* [ci] Add statuses:write permission for /test pre-commit by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1207\r\n* [ci] Remove Mergify ready-label race condition by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1208\r\n* [ci] Fix /merge to directly trigger Full Suite + simplify rebase conditions by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1209\r\n* [ci] Add retry for flaky tests and fix stale SSIM references by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1210\r\n* [ci] Ignore legacy reference videos when checking for HF download by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1211\r\n* [ci] Fix jq crash when Buildkite build env is null by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1212\r\n* [ci] Use pull_request_target for Full Suite trigger by @Eigensystem in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1213\r\n* [ci] Add direct test retry with check overwrite and aggregate status refresh by @Eigensystem in https:/