egression test by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1240\r\n* [feat] [6/n] Improve API: LTX-2 public preset + asset wiring + gpu_pool translation by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1239\r\n* [feat] Add typed LTX-2 continuation state and streaming session store by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1250\r\n* [bugfix]: normalize uint8 pil_image in I2V VAE encoding by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1249\r\n* [feat] Streaming WebSocket server skeleton (single generator + fMP4) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1251\r\n* [docs]: clarify real_score_guidance_scale CFG parameterization by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1256\r\n* [Perf] Skip bool-mask round-trip in block-sparse VSA attention by @Godmook in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1243\r\n* [bugfix] Fix modal remote functions crash container on sys exit in CI remote functions by @Satyam-53 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1261\r\n* [ci] add CPU unit tests for fastvideo.train load_run_config by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1264\r\n* [bugfix]: fix SP deadlock in negative prompt encoding during training by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1178\r\n* [ci] add CPU unit tests for train checkpoint utilities in fastvideo.train by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1265\r\n* [feat] Cosmos 2.5 training support in fastvideo.train by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1224\r\n* [feat] Stable Audio Open 1.0: T2A + A2A + RePaint inpainting (native) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1260\r\n* [ci] add CPU unit tests for train callback system in fastvideo.train by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1267\r\n* [misc] cleanup: grad-norm asserts, dead offload file, callback names by 