evaluation suite by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1305\r\n* [feat]: Loader umbrella-repo support + optional component dirs by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1294\r\n* [infra]: New skill - decompose-pipeline-pr by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1303\r\n* [ci] mergify: accept [skill]/[skills] and [infra] PR title tags by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1309\r\n* [feat]: add LongCat bidirectional finetuning support by @aryan5v in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1244\r\n* [misc]: import add-model skill stack to .agents/skills/ by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1308\r\n* [misc] attention hot-path cleanup + denoising loop hoists by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1272\r\n* [feat] FastVideo World Model Training by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1179\r\n* [feat] Add Cosmos 2.5 T2W training pipeline (LoRA + full fine-tune) by @Mister-Raggs in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1227\r\n* [docs] Dreamverse 01/14: Add integration provenance by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1324\r\n* [infra]: MagiHuman housekeeping (gitignore, codespell, skills index) (1/8) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1295\r\n* [docs] Dreamverse 02/14: Add app documentation by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1325\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 03/14: Add backend skeleton by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1326\r\n* [feat]: T5-Gemma encoder for MagiHuman pipeline (2/8) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1296\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 04/14: Add session and prompt logic by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1327\r\n* [feat]: MagiHuman DiT (transformer) port + parity tests (3/8) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1297\r\n* [feat]: MagiHuman pipeline stages (4/8) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1298\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 05/14: Add streaming runtime by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1328\r\n* [feat]: MagiHuman pipeline orchestrator + 10-test parity battery (5/8) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1299\r\n* [docs]: MagiHuman provenance - AGENTS.md, JOURNAL.md, lessons (6/8) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1300\r\n* [infra]: MagiHuman checkpoint conversion + push scripts (7/8) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1301\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 06/14: Add frontend scaffold by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1329\r\n* [ci] add GPU model loading tests for fastvideo.train (PR 4/9) by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1274\r\n* [bugfix] MatrixGame2 SF distillation under gradient checkpointing by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1340\r\n* feat: FP4 Flash Attention 4 for Blackwell GPUs by @Edenzzzz in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1221\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 07/14: Add frontend session UI by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1330\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 08/14: Add frontend media and E2E coverage by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1331\r\n* [infra] Dreamverse 09/14: Add Docker and launch scripts by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1332\r\n* [misc]: empty __init__.py files with no logic by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1346\r\n* [misc]: PR-1225 sync — housekeeping (1/12) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1347\r\n* [feat] eval: async VideoPool + metric streamlines by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1320\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 10/14: Add serving API contracts by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1333\r\n* [infra] Dreamverse 11/14: Add NVFP4 quantization support by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1334\r\n* [feat]: Add NVFP4QAT quantization config (Attn-QAT 2/12) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1348\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 12/14: Add LTX2 refine and upsampler support by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1335\r\n* [docs] Add copy page action by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1351\r\n* [misc]: Add Dreamverse deploy skill frontmatter by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1353\r\n* [feat] Dreamverse 13/14: Activate LTX2 integration by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1336\r\n* [perf] shallow-copy VSA attn_metadata in train model plugins by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1342\r\n* [perf] Dreamverse 14/14: Add LTX2 profile speedups by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1337\r\n* [feat]: Add NVFP4QAT linear layer (Attn-QAT 3/12) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1350\r\n* [misc]: demote ROCm-unavailable startup message to DEBUG by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1360\r\n* [feat] eval: add audio metrics by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1352\r\n* [infra] [dreamverse]: add instruction to install nasm and update ffmpeg installer to work in plain venv by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1361\r\n* [feat] Add minimal LoRA finetuning support to the YAML training stack by @radicalyyyahaha in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1242\r\n* [misc] Rename MatrixGame to MatrixGame2 by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1357\r\n* [fix] Fix causal self-forcing attention settings by @mignonjia in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1355\r\n* [feat]: add FastLTX-2.3 Gradio demo package (draft) by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1247\r\n* [perf] Mark LayerwiseOffloadHook entry points torch.compiler.disable (remove per-layer graph break) by @Mister-Raggs in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1365\r\n* [Bugfix] FP4 FA4 installation fix by @Edenzzzz in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1367\r\n* [bugfix]: shrink Dreamverse Docker context by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1368\r\n* [ci] Add Dreamverse Docker image workflow by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1369\r\n* [ci] Component time performance + reseed hf baseline skill by @Satyam-53 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1292\r\n* [feat] Optimize distributed weight loading in multi-node training by @Edenzzzz in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/572\r\n* [docs] Document performance benchmark workflow by @Satyam-53 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1376\r\n* [docs] Document enable_torch_compile (+ A/B example) by @Mister-Raggs in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1366\r\n* [feat]: Attn-QAT inference + training backends (deadcode) (Attn-QAT 4/12) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1358\r\n* chore: pin dreamverse npm deps to address Dependabot alerts by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1359\r\n* [infra] Add Dreamverse Modal UI image build by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1381\r\n* [infra] Use npm for Dreamverse web builds by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1385\r\n* [perf]: register FA2/FA3 default flash_attn_func as a torch.library custom op by @Mister-Raggs in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1373\r\n* [ci] Add DreamVerse app CI tests by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1386\r\n* [refactor]: shared attention infra additions for QAT-compat (Attn-QAT 5/12) by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1383\r\n* [refactor] eval: consolidate FVD into common.fvd, remove benchmarks/fvd by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1380\r\n* [ci] add per-method single-step training tests for fastvideo.train by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1343\r\n* [feat] VSA-256 fastpath on Blackwell via FA4 CuTe block-sparse attention by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1354\r\n* [docs]: Wire activation trace into mkdocs nav + perf/troubleshooting by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1304\r\n* [docs]: surface activation-trace utility in add-model skills by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1399\r\n* [feat] eval: input ergonomics + Evaluator features + bug fixes by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1392\r\n* [bugfix] Fix Dreamverse Modal compile warmup latency by @Davids048 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1394\r\n* [docs]: highlight Dreamverse deployment paths + add Server B200 (SSH) guide by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1409\r\n* [feat] Add MatrixGame3.0 by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1201\r\n* [feat] LTX-2.3 transformer support (config-gated extension of LTX-2) by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1397\r\n* [feat] LTX-2.3 audio: BWE vocoder path by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1398\r\n* [bugfix]: dreamverse modal bypasses ENTRYPOINT — set ffmpeg env + key check by @alexzms in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1413\r\n* [perf] Add Adaptive Guidance (CFG gating) for stale-uncond reuse by @rich7420 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1372\r\n* [ci] Add additional Dreamverse UI tests by @kevin314 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1417\r\n* [bugfix] Fix STFT dtype mismatch by @kevin314 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1419\r\n* [bugfix] LTX2: honor `video_position_offset_sec` in the DiT by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1422\r\n* [feat] LoRA controls and integration for Dreamverse by @H1yori233 in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1420\r\n* [feat] dreamverse: sequence parallelism for serving by @shaoxiongduan in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1424\r\n* [bugfix] tests: include ltx2_3_base in expected LTX2 preset set (#1427) by @Mister-Raggs in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1428\r\n* [chore]: unpin runtime deps in pyproject.toml by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1431\r\n* [chore]: release v0.2.0 by @SolitaryThinker in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1432\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @mignonjia made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1027\r\n* @Ishxn20 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1075\r\n* @dsynkd made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1108\r\n* @AjAnubolu made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1109\r\n* @GindaChen made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1151\r\n* @jaisurya27 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1088\r\n* @mergify[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1194\r\n* @vishruthb made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1059\r\n* @Satyam-53 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1174\r\n* @rich7420 made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1217\r\n* @klhhhhh made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1192\r\n* @Godmook made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1243\r\n* @aryan5v made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1244\r\n* @Mister-Raggs made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1227\r\n* @radicalyyyahaha made their first contribution in https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1242\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/compare/v0.1.7...v0.2.0","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Added longcat-video python api examples by @shaoxiongduan in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/994\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/994</a>\n</li>\n<li>[docs]: add LoRA extraction utilities documentation by @ShreejithSG in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/992\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/992</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix] Add configs for TurboDiffusion T2V/I2V models by @loaydatrain in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/993\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/993</a>\n</li>\n<li>[ci] temporarily disable turbodiffusion ssim test  by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1000\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1000</a>\n</li>\n<li>[CI] Fixed Turbodiffusion I2V CI  by @loaydatrain in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1002\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1002</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat!] Disable FSDP inference by default by @XOR-op in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1001\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1001</a>\n</li>\n<li>[misc] [bugfix] unpin 'av' in pyproject by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1009\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1009</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat] Introduce Cosmos 2.5 Text2World pipeline by @KyleShao1016 in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/974\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/974</a>\n</li>\n<li>[CI] SSIM tests optimization: load all model weights from Modal persistent Volume by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/958\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/958</a>\n</li>\n<li>[CI] Fix OOM issues in ssim tests by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1011\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1011</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Bug Fix] Add autograd wrapper for block-sparse attention in fastvideo-kernel + fix CMake extension linking by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1015\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1015</a>\n</li>\n<li>[chore] release fastvideo-kernel 0.2.3 by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1018\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1018</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat] Hooks API and layerwise offloading for all DiTs by @XOR-op in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1006\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1006</a>\n</li>\n<li>[kernel] Fix fastvideo-kernel release workflow by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1019\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1019</a>\n</li>\n<li>[kernel] [bugfix] [ci] bump v0.2.4. Fix STA output handling, TurboDiffusion CUDA norm dtypes for fastvideo-kernel unit tests. by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1020\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1020</a>\n</li>\n<li>Added LTX-2 Distilled T2V Generation by @shaoxiongduan in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1016\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1016</a>\n</li>\n<li>fix: SP for hunyuanvideo 1.5 by @XOR-op in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1026\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1026</a>\n</li>\n<li>[fastvideo-kernel] replace map to index with Triton implementation + add vsa benchmark by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1029\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1029</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix] add omegaconf as dep. by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1032\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1032</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix] Allow update timesteps for hy1.5 model. by @Davids048 in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1033\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1033</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat] Add HY-World1.5-Bidirectional-480P-I2V by @mignonjia in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1027\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1027</a>\n</li>\n<li>[ci] Increase ci test error threshold by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1038\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1038</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix] Fix NCCL all_gather contiguity + correct ParallelTiledVAE decode tiling threshold by @KyleShao1016 in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1037\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1037</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix]: handle architectural differences while lora extraction by @ShreejithSG in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1035\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1035</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix] fix torchvision import by @RandNMR73 in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1039\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1039</a>\n</li>\n<li>[docs] Update runpod instructions by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1043\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1043</a>\n</li>\n<li>[docs] Offloading instruction by @XOR-op in <a href=\"https://github.com/ha