on.fvd, remove benchmarks/fvd by @shaoxiongduan in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1380\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1380</a>\n</li>\n<li>[ci] add per-method single-step training tests for fastvideo.train by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1343\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1343</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat] VSA-256 fastpath on Blackwell via FA4 CuTe block-sparse attention by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1354\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1354</a>\n</li>\n<li>[docs]: Wire activation trace into mkdocs nav + perf/troubleshooting by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1304\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1304</a>\n</li>\n<li>[docs]: surface activation-trace utility in add-model skills by @SolitaryThinker in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1399\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1399</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat] eval: input ergonomics + Evaluator features + bug fixes by @shaoxiongduan in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1392\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1392</a>\n</li>\n<li>[bugfix] Fix Dreamverse Modal compile warmup latency by @Davids048 in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1394\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1394</a>\n</li>\n<li>[docs]: highlight Dreamverse deployment paths + add Server B200 (SSH) guide by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1409\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1409</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat] Add MatrixGame3.0 by @H1yori233 in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1201\">https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1201</a>\n</li>\n<li>[feat] LTX-2.3 transformer support (config-gated extension of LTX-2) by @alexzms in <a href=\"https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo/pull/1397\">https://github.com